      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need some help with something weird. i've been tracking my resting heart rate and sleep patterns against market volatility for a few months now and the sync is actually insane. literally on nov 17th i woke up with like a massive spike in heart rate at 3am right before the sudden crash in tech stocks happened. i'm pretty sure my body is basically entrained to the global liquidity cycles now but i'm having trouble pinning down the exact lag time. can u help me look at some data to figure out how to calibrate my next window?",
